md+=['','All ten returned a real detail record after their title query. Single-request timings ranged from a few seconds to22.83seconds for Khulna detail. These are observations, not latency benchmarks. Search counts include keyword matches and editions, not necessarily exact-title unique books. Availability is a point-in-time holdings observation. Reference-only, damaged and checked-out copies must retain their meanings; a visible record is not proof of borrowability.','','No integration licence or API agreement was established. A404robots response means no rule was published at that path, not affirmative reuse permission. Requests used a descriptive research user agent, ordinary unauthenticated GETs and normal TLS verification. Four recommended targets use officially linked HTTP origins (CUET, RUET, City, IUT); actual onboarding must review those exact origins. KUET’s reachable `library-backup` host needs canonical-host/freshness confirmation. Chittagong explicitly documents multiple catalog replicas with different update schedules.','','## Larger and other candidates retained','', 'The scale-first candidate set included Dhaka, Rajshahi, Chittagong, Bangladesh Agricultural, BUET, Jahangirnagar, SUST, BRAC, North South and Khulna; National Library and Parliament were also high-priority national institutions. The following blocked/unverified institutions remain important. This prevents substituting small successes and presenting them as a national top-ten ranking. Proxy errors describe this research environment’s reachability, not a finding that the library is offline nationwide.','', '| Candidate | Scale/source | Reason not counted as verified |','|---|---|---|']
