md+=['','## Recommended sequence','', '1. Start institutional onboarding with Chittagong, Khulna and IUB: live HTTPS catalogs, primary scale evidence and existing-parser reuse. Chittagong contributes the largest verified collection; Khulna needs latency handling and correct reference-only display.','2. Add IUT, City, KUET, Jagannath, Sylhet and the two engineering universities after their specific origin, freshness, parser and membership issues are resolved. This broadens city/discipline coverage but does not create open public borrowing rights.','3. Explore DPL/Amar Library for public-reader reach and a supported network interface. Revisit larger blocked targets through appropriate institutional interfaces/partnerships; do not bypass their robots or authentication restrictions.','','## Evidence and reproducibility','', 'The machine-readable [findings.json](findings.json) contains per-query UTC timestamps, exact GET URLs, HTTP status, elapsed time, returned book/record ID, detail requests, holdings, scale sources, robots evidence and limitations. `evidence/*-search.html`, `*-detail.html`, headers and metadata are saved raw snapshots for offline parser replay. [probe.py](probe.py) and the numbered input batches document requests. The sibling [adapter replay summary](../adapter-tools/koha-replay-summary.json) records compatibility tests. Research date differs from the inherited batch folder date: all direct probes here ran15November2026.','','Unused exploratory artifacts are not positive evidence: `ruet-detail-candidate` was an unrelated guessed candidate and is excluded from findings; `adust-detail` is CD/DVD34855, excluded in favor of `adust-detail-book`33012. This report relies on the latter verified result records.','','All statuses are point-in-time. Tests did not log in, place holds, borrow books, send messages, contact libraries or enable application integrations.']
